OL,3,GNEWSADate for market traders' return
OL,4,Aafter #9.4m revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FA date has been set for the reopening
OL,7,Fof Leicester Market following a #9.4m
OL,8,Fredevelopment.
OL,10,FStalls have been moved to a temporary
OL,11,Fsite in Green Dragon Square while the
OL,12,Frenovation work takes place.
OL,14,FLeicester City Council previously
OL,15,Findicated it aimed to have traders back
OL,16,Fon the square by the end of the year,
OL,17,Fbut it has now said it will work
OL,18,Ftowards reopening the market in April
OL,19,F2027.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
