OL,3,GNEWSADate for market traders' return
OL,4,Aafter #9.4m revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FCity mayor Sir Peter Soulsby said the
OL,7,Fauthority had offered traders an option
OL,8,Fto move back in December, but they
OL,9,Fpreferred a later date.
